{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "A1v2 \u00b7 pitch+roll prior w=0.5",
    "description": "State-prior A/B, stage 2 (2026-08-31): pitch AND roll.  The fore/aft-only prior cut rescues (40.1 -> 33.0/min) but tilt ROSE and down-became-quieter in 4/6 seeds \u2014 the one-channel prior scores a side-lying duck as upright (g_x = 0 both ways), a measured degenerate.  Bridges run load_slots 2 on reality.proprio.lean2 = [pitch, roll] per group; the prior holds BOTH at 0 (indices -2,-1).  Same unity operating point, sat_lr 0.  THIS ARM: state_prior_gain 0.5.",
    "env_target": "microduck",
    "phase_tag": "A1 (first brain)",
    "scaffolds_active": [
      "alpha_stand.onnx via the A2 recovery harness \u2014 drives only while the body is down, with all learning rates zeroed"
    ]
  },
